The law texts in laws/ come from the Open Law Book (ספר החוקים הפתוח) on Hebrew Wikisource,
https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/ויקיטקסט:ספר_החוקים_הפתוח, by its contributors, under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 licence, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ . Files with sourced law text
name the Wikisource page and revision; files without a confident source match contain Knesset metadata without
law text. This repository is under the same licence.

The ids, names, dates, stages, tallies and document links come from the Knesset's ParliamentInfo OData
service, https://knesset.gov.il/OdataV4/ParliamentInfo , and its documents on https://fs.knesset.gov.il .

Commits name members of the Knesset as authors only as a transcription of the official record: the
addresses are under the reserved .invalid domain and belong to no one. Nothing here is signed by them.
